          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, i understand that. I'm \u2014 I'm not worried about the sky falling, but I'm addressing your argument from the purpose of the statute. And you say the purpose is to preserve State revenues, but you come up with a theory that goes far beyond preserving State revenues. It permits the States to augment their \u2014 their revenues considerably."
